    <ThingDef ParentName="VGE_MechStructureBase">
        <defName>VGE_MechanoidOvershieldGenerator</defName>
        <label>mechanoid overshield</label>
        <description>A colossal defensive structure that projects a powerful, static energy shield with a huge radius. This barrier intercepts all incoming projectiles but permits fire from within. Once its substantial energy is depleted, the shield collapses, and the generator must endure a lengthy 15-day recharge cycle before the overshield can be redeployed.</description>
